      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WATCH AND SEE (1) goes very well at this journey here having never missed the frame including three wins and two placings. Hit the frame latest (19.40) when third at this track in a Other. Makes strong appeal on best. VELVET LEGEND (6) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at Murray Bridge over 395m behind Diogo Keeping (23.31) in a Grade 3/4/5. Placed at her previous run. Has the ability to give this a shake. ZIPPING WINDSOR (4) had been in great form but missed the frame latest when fourth (31.12) in a Grade 5 at Angle Park. Normally safe to begin but shuffled back last time off the low draw. The form out of his last race has been franked. Should be about the money. LUCY SCHOOL (8) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
